    "created_at": "2016-09-19T16:24:49Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-09-19T16:24:49Z",
    "body": "> Unless I'm missing something, the second radio isn't technically required, so the \"If an element in the radio button group is required\" does not apply to it, so it shouldn't be suffering from being missing... That's not the intention though.\n\nThe first element in the radio button group is required though, so \"an\" element in the radio button group is indeed required.\n",
