    "body": "Right. Let's walk through this. Let's check if element2 is suffering from being missing.\n\n> If an element in the radio button group (either **element1** or **element2** or both) is required, and all of the input elements in the radio button group (both **element1** and **element2**) have a checkedness that is false, then the element (**element2**) is suffering from being missing.\n\nSince element1 is required, and both element1 and element2 have a false checkedness, then element2 is suffering from being missing.\n",
